ranslator: a deterministic parser reads Facebook’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".origami"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"patch graph into a semantic IR, and a codegen writes that IR out as SwiftUI. Swami"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"is also the patch-matched helper library that fills gaps between Origami patches"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and native SwiftUI — one helper per Origami patch, named after the patch, sized by"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Origami’s patch surface. Every pattern that lands is a deliverable, verified against"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Origami’s own render, and shipped as a DocC-embedded example."}],"role":"collection","identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami","type":"topic","title":"Swami"},"doc://samatwork.Swami/documentation/Swami/Interaction_DragView/searchable(text:placement:prompt:)-7d051":{"url":"\/documentation\/swami\/interaction_dragview\/searchable(text:placement:prompt:)-7d051","abstract":[],"role":"symbol","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","title":"searchable(text:placement:prompt:)","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"searchable"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"text"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Binding","preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI7BindingV"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"String","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"},{"kind":"text","text":">, "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"placement"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"SearchFieldPlacement","preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI20SearchFieldPlacementV"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"prompt"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"LocalizedStringKey","preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI18LocalizedStringKeyV"},{"kind":"text","text":"